         </div>\n\n                    \n                    <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-brand-navy/70 italic line-clamp-1 mb-3\">THE FASTEST HANDS IN THE EAST MEET THE BIGGEST MOUTH IN THE WEST.\r\n\r\nWhen Hong Kong Inspector Lee is summoned to Los Angeles to investigate a kidnapping, the FBI doesn’t want any outside help and assigns cocky LAPD Detective James Carter to distract Lee from the case. Not content to watch the action from the sidelines, Lee and Carter form an unlikely partnership and investigate the case themselves.</p>\n                    \n\n                    <button data-screening-details=\"5496e9b9-26b7-4f8b-aff8-fd1eafe4347e\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-2 border-b border-brand-navy/40 cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy\">More Details</span>\n                        <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 md:w-6 md:h-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                            <path d=\"M26.667 21.333C29.6124 21.3332 32 23.7216 32 26.667C31.9998 29.6123 29.6123 31.9998 26.667 32H5.33301C2.38774 31.9998 0.000173164 29.6123 0 26.667C0 23.7216 2.38764 21.3332 5.33301 21.333C2.38764 21.3328 0 18.9454 0 16C2.57701e-06 13.0546 2.38764 10.6672 5.33301 10.667C2.38764 10.6668 0 8.27842 0 5.33301C0.000178318 2.38775 2.38775 0.000178659 5.33301 0H26.667C29.6123 0.000176597 31.9998 2.38775 32 5.33301C32 8.27842 29.6124 10.6668 26.667 10.667C29.6124 10.6672 32 13.0546 32 16C32 18.9454 29.6124 21.3328 26.667 21.333Z\" fill=\"#5C9AC6\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M10.5 16H21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M16 10.5V21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-1 md:col-start-3 md:row-start-1 md:row-spa