       </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 3h4a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-4M10 17l5-5-5-5M15 12H3\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Doors open at <span>7:15 PM</span></span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\"/>\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Peckham, London</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                    <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-brand-navy/70 italic line-clamp-1 mb-3\">A group of professional bank robbers start to feel the heat from police when they unknowingly leave a clue at their latest heist, while both sides attempt to find balance between their personal lives with their professional lives.</p>\n                    \n\n                    <button data-screening-details=\"6350746f-b45b-4529-afc0-e950c2a5294a\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-2 border-b border-brand-navy/40 cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-b