          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"a63c626b-58f3-4daa-b380-2530696c0dad\",\"title\":\"The Sopranos\",\"url\":\"\\/uk\\/london\\/peckham\\/screenings\\/the-sopranos-3054\",\"external_booking_url\":null,\"date\":\"Sun, Aug 16\",\"time\":\"7:15 PM\",\"door_time\":\"6:15 PM\",\"minimum_age\":18,\"short_description\":\"TV Mini-Marathon\",\"long_description\":\"<p>Join us on the rooftop as we revisit three of the most iconic episodes from the series that basically invented prestige television. Family drama, mafia politics, therapy sessions and some of the funniest accidental comedy ever put on screen? It's all here.<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>Featuring College (S1, Ep5), Pine Barrens (S3, Ep11) and Long Term Parking (S5, Ep12), this mini marathon brings together some of the most talked-about episodes in TV history. From existential crises and disastrous road trips to moments that'll leave you staring into the distance afterwards, this is peak television.<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>If you've somehow never watched The Sopranos, congratulations - you're about to discover why people won't stop talking about it nearly 30 years later.<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>Grab a drink, settle in and spend a few hours with Tony, Carmela, Christopher, Paulie and the rest of the gang under the stars.<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>This is character development.<\\/p>\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dpgypjrov\\/image\\/fetch\\/f_auto,w_600,h_450,c_fill,q_auto\\/https:\\/\\/d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net\\/PRODUCTION\\/films\\/5bfb0190-1cd3-426c-8cea-5be64bd50cf1\\/The-Sopranos-(1).png\",\"venue_title\":\"Peckham, London\",\"collections\":[],\"seasons\":[],\"tags\":[],\"accessibility\":[],\"sold_out\":true}",
            "size": 1616
          },
