          "redirectURL": "",
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"5ca4a5ae-d6b1-472c-8768-e6b07e750e4f\",\"title\":\"Princess Diaries Bedazzle Club\",\"url\":\"\\/uk\\/london\\/peckham\\/screenings\\/princess-diaries-bedazzle-club-3052\",\"external_booking_url\":null,\"date\":\"Sun, Aug 30\",\"time\":\"7:00 PM\",\"door_time\":\"6:30 PM\",\"minimum_age\":18,\"short_description\":\"Bedazzling Workshop + Movie\",\"long_description\":\"<p>A royal makeover is calling. \\u2728<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>Before we press play on The Princess Diaries, join us for a sparkling bedazzling workshop inspired by Mia Thermopolis' iconic transformation. PLEASE NOTE - for those purchasing the workshop ticket - the start time for this is 7pm, and the screening of The Princess Diaries will begin at 8:30pm.<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>We'll bring the rhinestones, glue and all the expertise you need to create your perfect Y2K masterpiece. You bring the canvas - whether that's a denim jacket, tote bag, baseball cap, trainers or even a tiara fit for Genovia.<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>Leading the workshop is Fen Fitzgerald, a multidisciplinary creative maker with a degree in Textile Design specialising in hand embroidery and embellishment. Fen has worked on the costumes for Academy Award-winning films Wicked and Wicked: For Good, as well as 28 Years Later, and has collaborated with Arsenal WFC, Hackney Pride Fayre and Queer Creatives London. Alongside her work in film and fashion, Fen runs creative workshops teaching embellishment, embroidery and clothing mending.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>Come ready to add some sparkle, channel your inner princess and create something fit for royalty before enjoying The Princess Diaries under the stars. \\ud83d\\udc51\\ud83d\\udc8e<\\/p>\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dpgypjrov\\/image\\/fetch\\/f_auto,w_600,h_450,c_fill,q_auto\\/https:\\/\\/d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net\\/PRODUCTION\\/films\\/3d2a1e4f-f404-4292-a429-3513cb55db40\\/Charm-School-Hero.jpg\",\"venue_title\":\"Peckham, London\",\"collections\":[],\"seasons\":[],\"tags\":[{\"title\":\"Girls Gone Mild\"},{\"title\":\"Event\"}],\"accessibility\":[],\"sold_out\":true}",
            "size": 2051
          },
          "bodySize": 2051
        },
