.91914 15.7598L12.5474 18.5414C13.3536 19.3948 14.8344 18.8081 14.7741 17.6607L14.5741 13.9196L18.4911 14.1106C19.6925 14.1697 20.3067 12.7539 19.4132 11.9839Z\"/>\n        <path class=\"stroke-brand-white group-hover/notify:stroke-brand-navy transition-colors\" d=\"M5.92969 9.12109H13.2772\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n        <path class=\"stroke-brand-white group-hover/notify:stroke-brand-navy transition-colors\" d=\"M10.3398 6.31641L13.2788 9.12342L10.3398 11.9304\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n    </svg>\n</button>\n\n\n\n\n                \n                \n                \n            </div>\n\n            \n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4\">\n                \n                \n                \n                <span class=\"px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium rounded bg-brand-red text-brand-white\">Sold Out</span>\n\n                \n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 z-10 px-6 lg:px-12 pb-8 flex flex-col items-end gap-2\">\n        \n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center text-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-lightbeige text-brand-navy\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-xl leading-none\">18+</h3>\n        </div>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"w-[90%] bg-brand-honey rounded-lg py-16 px-12 mx-auto space-y-12 my-16\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-navy leading-tight\">\n        Screening Details\n    </h2>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-16 gap-y-6 md:gap-y-10 mb-20 px-0 md:px-8\">\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Film</h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\"><a href=\"/uk/films/the-sopranos\" class=\"underline\">The Sopranos</a></div>\n            \n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Venue</h2>\n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\"><a href=\"/uk/london/peckham\" class=\"underline\">Peckham, London</a></div>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Screen</h2>\n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\">Screen 1</div>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Duration</h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\">160 Minutes</div>\n            \n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Door Time</h2>\n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\">60 mins</div>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n        \n\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Date</h2>\n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\">Sun, Aug 16</div>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Time</h2>\n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\">7:15 PM</div>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Year</h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\">1999</div>\n            \n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rounded-2xl p-10 text-brand-navy/80\">\n        <p>Join us on the rooftop as we revisit three of the most iconic episodes from the series that basically invented prestige television. Family drama, mafia politics, therapy sessions and some of the funniest accidental comedy ever put on screen? It's all here.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Featuring College (S1, Ep5), Pine Barrens (S3, Ep11) and Long Term Parking (S5, Ep12), this mini marathon brings together some of the most talked-about episodes in TV history. From existential crises and disastrous road trips to moments that'll leave you staring into the distance afterwards, this is peak television.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If you've somehow never watched The Sopranos, congratulations - you're about to discover why people won't stop talking about it nearly 30 years later.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Grab a drink, settle in and spend a few hours with Tony, Carmela, Christopher, Paulie and the rest of the gang under the stars.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This is character development.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-8\">\n\n        <div class=\"md:hidden relative\">\n            <div class=\"relative\">\n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_400,h_300,c_fill,g_xy_center,x_2045,y_535,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/5bfb0190-1cd3-426c-8cea-5be64bd50cf1/The-Sopranos-(1).png\" alt=\"Peckham, London outdoor screening of The-Sopranos-(1).png in London\" class=\"w-[45%] aspect-[4/3] object-cover rounded-xl relative z-10 -ml-4 shadow-lg\">\n                \n                \n                \n            </div>\n\n            \n            <div class=\"bg-brand-navy text-brand-white rounded-2xl p-5 pt-10 -mt-6 relative z-0\">\n                <div class=\"prose prose-invert prose-sm leading-relaxed max-w-none\">\n                    <p>New Jersey mob boss Tony Soprano deals with personal and professional issues in his home and business life that affect his mental state, leading him to seek professional psychiatric counseling.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hidden md:flex relative flex-row items-center gap-0 min-h-[350px]\">\n            \n            <div class=\"bg-brand-navy text-brand-white rounded-2xl p-10 w-1/2 z-10 relative -mr-12 shadow-2xl\">\n                <div class=\"prose prose-invert prose-lg leading-relaxed max-w-none\">\n                    <p>New Jersey mob boss Tony Soprano deals with personal and professional issues in his home and business life that affect his mental state, leading him to seek professional psychiatric counseling.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n\n            <div class=\"w-1/2 z-0\">\n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_900,h_450,c_fill,g_xy_center,x_2045,y_535,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/5bfb0190-1cd3-426c-8cea-5be64bd50cf1/The-Sopranos-(1).png\" alt=\"Peckham, London outdoor screening of The-Sopranos-(1).png in London\" class=\"w-full h-[450px] object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-inner\">\n                \n                \n                \n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n        </main>\n\n        <div id=\"tickets-checkout-root\"></div>\n        <div id=\"gift-card-checkout-root\"></div>\n\n        <div id=\"modals-root\"></div>\n\n        <footer class=\"w-full bg-brand-red text-brand-white px-4 md:px-12 py-12\">\n\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 mb-12 items-start\">\n        \n            <div>\n                <div cl