 \n\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Date</h2>\n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\">Tue, Aug 18</div>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Time</h2>\n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\">6:30 PM</div>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Year</h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\">2013</div>\n            \n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rounded-2xl p-10 text-brand-navy/80\">\n        \n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-8\">\n\n        <div class=\"md:hidden relative\">\n            <div class=\"relative\">\n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_400,h_300,c_fill,g_xy_center,x_959,y_540,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/68308db9-b31f-4557-ab8f-88161b715904/abouttime_1920x1080.jpg\" alt=\"Peckham, London outdoor screening of abouttime_1920x1080.jpg in London\" class=\"w-[45%] aspect-[4/3] object-cover rounded-xl relative z-10 -ml-4 shadow-lg\">\n                \n                \n                \n            </div>\n\n            \n            <div class=\"bg-brand-navy text-brand-white rounded-2xl p-5 pt-10 -mt-6 relative z-0\">\n                <div class=\"prose prose-invert prose-sm leading-relaxed max-w-none\">\n                    WHAT IF EVERY MOMENT IN LIFE CAME WITH A SECOND CHANCE?\r\n\r\nThe night after another unsatisfactory New Year party, Tim’s father tells his son that the men in his family have always had the ability to travel through time. Tim can’t change history, but he can change what happens and has happened in his own life – so he decides to make his world a better place… by getting a girlfriend. Sadly, that turns out not to be as easy as he thinks.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hidden md:flex relative flex-row items-center gap-0 min-h-[350px]\">\n            \n            <div class=\"bg-brand-navy text-brand-white rounded-2xl p-10 w-1/2 z-10 relative -mr-12 shadow-2xl\">\n                <div class=\"prose prose-invert prose-lg leading-relaxed max-w-none\">\n                    WHAT IF EVERY MOMENT IN LIFE CAME WITH A SECOND CHANCE?\r\n\r\nThe night after another unsatisfactory New Year party, Tim’s father tells his son that the men in his family have always had the ability to travel through time. Tim can’t change history, but he can change what happens and has happened in his own life – so he decides to make his world a better place… by getting a girlfriend. Sadly, that turns out not to be as easy as he thinks.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n\n            <div class=\"w-1/2 z-0\">\n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_900,h_450,c_fill,g_xy_center,x_959,y_540,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/68308db9-b31f-4557-ab8f-88161b715904/abouttime_1920x1080.jpg\" alt=\"Peckham, London outdoor screening of abouttime_1920x1080.jpg in London\" class=\"w-full h-[450px] object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-inner\">\n                \n                \n                \n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n<div x-cloak x-show=\"show_trailer\" @keydown.escape.window=\"show_trailer = false\"\n     class=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n\n    <div class=\"absolute i