eks to rediscover his manhood with the help of a newfound friend, Jacob, learning to pick up girls at bars.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hidden md:flex relative flex-row items-center gap-0 min-h-[350px]\">\n            \n            <div class=\"bg-brand-navy text-brand-white rounded-2xl p-10 w-1/2 z-10 relative -mr-12 shadow-2xl\">\n                <div class=\"prose prose-invert prose-lg leading-relaxed max-w-none\">\n                    A middle-aged husband's life changes dramatically when his wife asks him for a divorce. He seeks to rediscover his manhood with the help of a newfound friend, Jacob, learning to pick up girls at bars.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n\n            <div class=\"w-1/2 z-0\">\n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_900,h_450,c_fill,g_xy_center,x_485,y_273,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/9bcfd959-d509-48d0-9ed7-1fb24d97c4f2/film__16771-crazy-stupid-love--hi_res-7bb837cc.jpeg\" alt=\"Peckham, London outdoor screening of film__16771-crazy-stupid-love--hi_res-7bb837cc.jpeg in London\" class=\"w-full h-[450px] object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-inner\">\n                \n                \n                \n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n<div x-cloak x-show=\"show_trailer\" @keydown.escape.window=\"show_trailer = false\"\n     class=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/80\" @click=\"show_trailer = false\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-4xl z-10\" @click.stop>\n        <button @click=\"show_trailer = false\"\n                class=\"absolute -top-10 right-0 text-white hover:opacity-80 cursor-pointer\">\n            <svg class=\"w-8 h-8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox