9.5L0.407141 12.0172C-0.44864 12.7894 0.139614 14.2076 1.29028 14.1498L5.04173 13.9583L4.85021 17.7097C4.79093 18.8604 6.21064 19.4486 6.98282 18.5929L9.5 15.8036L12.0172 18.5929C12.7894 19.4486 14.2076 18.8604 14.1498 17.7097L13.9583 13.9583L17.7097 14.1498C18.8604 14.2091 19.4486 12.7894 18.5929 12.0172Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n                    </svg>\n                </span>\n                7:00 PM\n            </p>\n\n            <h1 class=\"text-2xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black uppercase leading-tight mb-3 md:mb-5 tracking-tight\">\n                Sex and the City\n            </h1>\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 md:gap-5\">\n                \n\n<button data-checkout-screening=\"8a93e078-b951-4354-9b95-f14de9e4b699\"\n        class=\"cursor-pointer inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-xs sm:px-5 sm:py-2.5 sm:text-sm md:px-6 md:py-2.5 md:text-[16px] font-bold border-2 border-transparent bg-brand-lavenderpink text-brand-navy transition-colors duration-150 hover:bg-brand-honey active:bg-brand-honey\">\n    Book\n</button>\n\n\n\n\n\n                \n                \n                \n            </div>\n\n            \n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4\">\n                \n                \n                \n                <div class=\"text-center py-1 px-3 text-xs font-medium rounded\" style=\"background-color: #3156d2; color: #f9f4ee;\">Mini Marathons</div>\n                \n                \n                \n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 z-10 px-6 lg:px-12 pb-8 flex flex-col items-end gap-2\">\n        \n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center text-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-lightbeige text-brand-navy\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-xl leading-none\">18+</h3>\n        </div>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 justify-end\">\n            \n            <span class=\"px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded bg-white text-brand-navy font-medium\">\n            Event\n        </span>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"w-[90%] bg-brand-honey rounded-lg py-16 px-12 mx-auto space-y-12 my-16\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-navy leading-tight\">\n        Screening Details\n    </h2>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-16 gap-y-6 md:gap-y-10 mb-20 px-0 md:px-8\">\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Film</h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\"><a href=\"/uk/films/sex-and-the-city-1\" class=\"underline\">Sex and the City</a></div>\n            \n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Venue</h2>\n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\"><a href=\"/uk/london/peckham\" class=\"underline\">Peckham, London</a></div>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Screen</h2>\n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\">Screen 1</div>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Duration</h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\">150 Minutes</div>\n            \n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Door Time</h2>\n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\">60 mins</div>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n        \n\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Date</h2>\n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\">Tue, Sep 15</div>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Time</h2>\n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\">7:00 PM</div>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wide mb-1\">Year</h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy/80 mb-4\"></div>\n            \n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy/30\">\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rounded-2xl p-10 text-brand-navy/80\">\n        <p>Fashion Week deserves a front row seat.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Celebrate London Fashion Week with a mini Sex&nbsp;and the City marathon, showcasing three of Carrie Bradshaw's most iconic fashion-filled episodes.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>From Carrie's unforgettable catwalk tumble in The Real Me, to the glamour of A Vogue Idea, before finishing in couture-filled Paris with An American Girl in Paris: Part Une, this is a love letter to the style moments that helped define a generation.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Slip on your favourite heels (or your comfiest trainers), grab a cocktail and settle in for an evening of Manolos, martinis and Manhattan's most fashionable foursome &ndash; all under the London skyline.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-8\">\n\n        <div class=\"md:hidden relative\">\n            <div class=\"relative\">\n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_400,h_300,c_fill,g_xy_center,x_960,y_540,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/5f679e6d-ab78-416e-9d57-3037c04fc577/Sex-and-the-City-Hero.jpg\" alt=\"Peckham, London outdoor screening of Sex-and-the-City-Hero.jpg in London\" class=\"w-[45%] aspect-[4/3] object-cover rounded-xl relative z-10 -ml-4 shadow-lg\">\n                \n                \n                \n            </div>\n\n            \n            <div class=\"bg-brand-navy text-brand-white rounded-2xl p-5 pt-10 -mt-6 relative z-0\">\n                <div class=\"prose prose-invert prose-sm leading-relaxed max-w-none\">\n                    Four career women navigate life in NYC. Carrie writes about relationships, Charlotte runs an art gallery, Miranda practices law, and Samantha excels in PR. Each brings unique views on love, work, and friendship.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hidden md:flex relative flex-row items-center gap-0 min-h-[350px]\">\n            \n            <div class=\"bg-brand-navy text-brand-white rounded-2xl p-10 w-1/2 z-10 relative -mr-12 shadow-2xl\">\n                <div class=\"prose prose-invert prose-lg leading-relaxed max-w-none\">\n                    Four career women navigate life in NYC. Carrie writes about relationships, Charlotte runs an art gallery, Miranda practices law, and Samantha excels in PR. Each brings unique views on love, work, and friendship.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n\n            <div class=\"w-1/2 z-0\">\n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_900,h_450,c_fill,g_xy_center,x_960,y_540,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/5f679e6d-ab78-416e-9d57-3037c04fc577/Sex-and-the-City-Hero.jpg\" alt=\"Peckham, London outdoor screening of Sex-and-the-City-Hero.jpg in London\" class=\"w-full h-[450px] object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-inner\">\n                \n                \n                \n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n        </main>\n\n        <div id=\"tickets-checkout-root\"></div>\n        <div id=\"gift-card-checkout-root\"></div>\n\n        <div id=\"modals-root\"></div>\n\n        <footer class=\"w-full bg-brand-red text-brand-white px-4 md:px-12 py-12\">\n\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 mb-12 items-start\">\n        \n            <div>\n                <div class=\"inline-flex justify-start items-center\">\n                    <a href=\"/uk/locations\">\n                        <img src=\"/images/Rooftop_Cinema_Logo_Cream.svg\" alt=\"Rooftop Cinema Club\" class=\"h-10 md:h-20\">\n                    </a>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-start items-center gap-2 border-l border-l-white ml-4 pl-4\">\n                        <span class=\"text-white font-heading text-[10px] md:text-sm leading-none uppercase\">in partnership with</span>\n                        <svg class=\"w-28 md:w-32\" xml:space=\"preserve\" viewBox=\"0 0 1033.143 564.983\"><path fill=\"white\" d=\"m945.022 304.383-.004.004-4.762.004c-1.174 0-2.272.353-3.332 1.435-1.315 1.344-1.515 3.068-1.197 4.754 3.863 20.609 5.852 40.725 6.502 59.701h-59.77c-1.35 0-2.467.478-3.36 1.362-.94.93-1.521 2.114-1.52 4.058l.005 17.154c.002 3.414 2.352 5.32 5.188 5.32h59.437c-.444 13.108-1.468 25.43-2.867 36.454a407 407 0 0 1-3.687 23.545c-.258 2.058.286 3.354 1.281 4.457 1.188 1.19 2.573 1.474 4.205 1.473l5.93-.008 9.222.008a7.12 7.12 0 0 0 5.135-2.153c1.538-1.579 1.802-3.268 1.969-4.242a439 439 0 0 0 3.322-22.938c1.299-11.067 2.247-23.436 2.658-36.595h58.573c2.835 0 5.186-1.907 5.187-5.32l.006-17.155c0-1.944-.58-3.129-1.52-4.058-.893-.884-2.01-1.362-3.36-1.362H969.39a435 435 0 0 0-2.52-35.105 423 423 0 0 0-3.517-24.613c-.294-1.686-.876-